# --- DIAN credentials & test fixtures: NEVER commit these ---
# Real tests (soap/real*_test.go, signer/signer_real_test.go, builder/*_real_test.go) read
# certificates, .p12/.pfx files, PINs, and NITs from a local directory referenced via the
# COFACTURE_TEST_FIXTURES_DIR environment variable. That directory must live outside the repo.
*.p12
*.pfx
*_cert.pem
*_key.pem
/fixtures/
/testfixtures/
/docs/reference/
.env
.env.*
